---
type Level = '高' | '低'
interface Props {
  items: {
    era: string
    subject: string
    leverage: Level
    coordination: Level
    outcome: string
  }[]
}
const { items } = Astro.props
---

<figure class='essay-progression essay-wide'>
  <figcaption><span class='essay-label'>杠杆与协调</span><span>三种社会处境</span></figcaption>
  <ol>
    {
      items.map((item, index) => (
        <li>
          <span class='essay-label' aria-hidden='true'>
            {String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
          </span>
          <h3>{item.era}</h3>
          <p class='essay-progression-subject'>{item.subject}</p>
          <dl>
            <div>
              <>
                <dt>物质杠杆</dt>
                <dd>{item.leverage}</dd>
              </>
              <span
                class:list={['essay-bar', { 'is-high': item.leverage === '高' }]}
                aria-hidden='true'
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <>
                <dt>协调能力</dt>
                <dd>{item.coordination}</dd>
              </>
              <span
                class:list={['essay-bar', { 'is-high': item.coordination === '高' }]}
                aria-hidden='true'
              />
            </div>
          </dl>
          <p class='essay-progression-outcome'>{item.outcome}</p>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>
  <p class='essay-figure-note'>
    论证示意，非历史数据。后 AI 一栏假设通信仍然畅通；监控与压制还可能进一步削弱协调能力。
  </p>
</figure>
